  "all_five_components_change_eid_star": true,
  "all_five_components_change_eid_r": true,
  "why_this_answers_the_auditor": "the claim 'EID_r is derived from EID*' is only meaningful if a third party can see which inputs reach it. The provenance section rendered into loreley.program.md carries all five component digests, so campaign_program_hash - and hence EID_r - changes for every one of the five, which the table above measures rather than asserts. No part of EID_r is a hash of a generated script that the inputs do not reach: the two hash inputs are the plugin source file (the code that will run) and the rendered program (a function of all five component digests)."
 }
